{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03924","headline":"奉和送金城公主适西蕃应制 · 韦元旦","name":"奉和送金城公主适西蕃应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柔远安夷俗，和亲重汉年。\n军容旌节送，国命锦车传。\n琴曲悲千里，箫声恋九天。\n唯应西海月，来就掌珠圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦元旦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}